@startuml AuthAndCatalogue
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "LoginFragment" as UI
participant "ViewModel" as VM
participant "Repository" as Repo
participant "Retrofit/OkHttp" as Net
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "DataStore" as DS

== Авторизация ==

User -> UI: Ввод email/password
User -> UI: Нажатие "Войти"
activate UI

UI -> VM: login(email, password)
activate VM

VM -> Repo: authenticate(email, password)
activate Repo

Repo -> Net: POST /api/auth
activate Net
Net -> API: POST /api/auth
activate API
API --> Net: {token, user}
deactivate API

Net --> Repo: {token, user}
deactivate Net

Repo -> DS: saveToken(token)
activate DS
DS --> Repo: saved
deactivate DS

Repo -> DS: saveUser(user)
activate DS
DS --> Repo: saved
deactivate DS

Repo --> VM: Success
deactivate Repo

VM --> UI: LoginSuccess
deactivate VM

UI -> UI: Navigate to Catalogue
deactivate UI

note over User,DS
    Пользователь авторизован
    Token сохранён в DataStore
end note

== Просмотр каталога ==

activate UI

UI -> VM: loadCatalogue()
activate VM

VM -> Repo: getCars()
activate Repo

Repo -> Net: GET /api/car/catalogue
activate Net
note over Net
Retrofit + OkHttp
AuthInterceptor добавляет Bearer
end note

alt Access token истёк (401)
    Net -> API: GET /api/car/catalogue
    activate API
    API --> Net: 401 Unauthorized
    deactivate API

    Net -> API: POST /api/auth/refresh
    activate API
    API --> Net: newAccessToken
    deactivate API

    Net -> DS: saveToken(newAccessToken)
    activate DS
    DS --> Net: saved
    deactivate DS

    Net -> API: GET /api/car/catalogue (retry)
    activate API
    API --> Net: List<Car>
    deactivate API
else OK
    Net -> API: GET /api/car/catalogue
    activate API
    API --> Net: List<Car>
    deactivate API
end

Net --> Repo: List<Car>
deactivate Net

Repo --> VM: List<Car>
deactivate Repo

VM --> UI: Update LiveData
deactivate VM

UI -> User: Показать список авто
deactivate UI

@enduml
